    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n66455" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεσό-λευκος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>middling white</i>,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χιτὼν πορφυροῦς μ.</span> a tunic of
			purple <i>shot with white</i>, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Cyr.</u>
				8.3.13
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Alex.</u>
				11
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. χιτών</span> alone, <i><span class="en">
				<u>JHS</u>
				41.195
			</span></i> (Delos, <span class="entity">ii B. C.</span>), <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				36.52
			</span></i>; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πορφύρεος</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Ephipp.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				12.537e
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χλαμὺς μ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					78.3
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Subst., a precious stone, <i><span class="en">
				Plin.
				<u>HN</u>
				37.174
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λευκὰς ὀρεινή</span>
			, ib.<i><span class="en">
				27.102
			</span></i>.</div>
